M677 : (a,b) = (6,11); M677i : (a,b) = (9,8) = (1+t^3, t^3), idempotent;
M1313 : (a,b) = (2,6); M1313i : (a,b) = (8,9) = (t^3, 1+t^3), idempotent.
They refute the conjecture CLM-C05-09 (spectra {1} together with the odd n >= 5). -/

